  "name": "Operation Lockdown",
  "location": "A Metropolitan City Center",
  "overview": "Rain lashes down as a metropolis transforms into a contested battlefield. Towering skyscrapers collapse into rubble while city squares harden into entrenched positions, thick with concrete dust and the acrid scent of spent ammunition. Once a symbol of prosperity, the city now stands as both prize and graveyard—its shattered streets the stage for the war’s next decisive clash.\n\nFighting has erupted in the city center, where towering spires of concrete and steel conceal vital positions. Command has identified key districts—transport hubs, power relays, and fortified plazas—that must be secured to maintain control of the city. Enemy forces are converging rapidly, and intelligence reports indicate tight quarters as you approach the city center. Control of these districts is crucial: failure will mean loss of the city.",
  "objectives": "Secure critical positions (Objective tokens) on the outskirts of the city and within the city center following the standard rules for contesting and controlling Objectives. Each position you control at the end of a Phase will award victory points as described below.\n\n• The central position (1) at the heart of the city is worth 8 victory points.\n\n• Each of the positions on the city outskirts (2, 3, 4) are worth 5 victory points."
}
